  "id": "fig-choice-n21-parallel",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Two new shared-family frames I and II, not six independent line thumbnails. I: a has y=2x, b has y=2x-3, c has y=2x+4. II: d has y=-x/2, e has y=-x/2-2, f has y=-x/2+3. Numeric axes and letter labels only. Each family has equal slopes and distinct y intercepts. Authored family labels I/II and line labels a..f; no formula labels. Preserve the source prose's common-coordinate-system instruction within each family.",
  "source": {
    "authoredBasis": "Two new shared-family frames I and II, not six independent line thumbnails. I: a has y=2x, b has y=2x-3, c has y=2x+4. II: d has y=-x/2, e has y=-x/2-2, f has y=-x/2+3. Numeric axes and letter labels only. Each family has equal slopes and distinct y intercepts. Authored family labels I/II and line labels a..f; no formula labels. Preserve the source prose's common-coordinate-system instruction within each family. This is newly authored mathematics, not a recovered original. Figure 77 was visually inspected only for general axes styling and is not provenance. Numeric scales, plotting windows and panel layout are deliberate authored additions. No formula is printed on the graph.",
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n21",
        "exercise": "317",
        "text": "在同一坐标系里作出下列各式给出的线性函数的图象：\na) $y=2x,$ $y=2x-3,$ $y=2x+4$\nb) $y=-0.5x,$ $y=-0.5x-2,$ $y=-0.5x+3$。指出每一条直线的系数 $k$ 和 $l$ 的值。图象的相互位置怎样？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n21",
        "text": "式 $y=kx+l$ 给出的函数，它的图象的位置决定于 $k$ 和 $l$的值的大小。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n21",
        "text": "系数 $k$ 决定线性函数的图象对 $x$ 轴的倾斜角的大小。\n如果 $k$ 是正数，那么倾斜角是锐角（图 $79$a）；\n如果 $k$ 是负数，那么倾斜角是钝角（图 $79$b）。\n\n数 $k$ 叫做直线的斜率。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n21",
        "text": "如果 $x=0$，那么 $y=l$。\n就是说，线性函数的图象和 $y$ 轴的交点，纵坐标等于 $l$。"
      }
    ],
